    "catalog:tags": "urinal, wall-hung, washroom",
    "catalog:note": "Wall-hung urinal: a back panel; a bowl of two cheeks, a floor and a front lip, 0.35 deep from the wall; and above it a hood of two cheeks and a top, stepped back to 0.175 from the wall. bottom 0.35, rim 0.60. The bowl is drawn square: a rounded bowl and a sloped hood wait for format v2.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "0.35 x 0.35 x 0.65, bottom 0.35 and rim 0.60 are generic practice sizes, not checked against a published source (unverified). Port sizes from the drafting standard (BS EN 12056-2 conventions), unverified",
